// Kronos ("Desktop Integration & Standalone App Icons"): real Windows
// executable-icon resource script for kronos_studio.exe specifically --
// see kronos.rc's own comment for why this only matters on a real
// Windows build (no MSVC/MinGW toolchain here to compile it against).
// Distinct from kronos.rc/engine_runtime's shared flagship icon: each
// of the 4 standalone creator apps gets its own accent-colored icon
// (see engine/src/CMakeLists.txt's own add_executable() calls) so
// Explorer/the taskbar can actually tell them apart, matching the
// distinct per-app accent colors StudioApp::accentColor() already
// established (Electric Violet for Studio).
IDI_ICON1 ICON "kronos_studio_icon.ico"
